# Deploy

# 1\. Tag the commit the installer was built from

```
git tag -a v0.1.28 -m "Trundler 0.1.28"
git push origin v0.1.28
```

# 2\. Create the release and attach the installer

```
gh release create v0.1.28 \
  "dist/Trundler Setup 0.1.28.exe" \
  "dist/Trundler Setup 0.1.28.exe.blockmap" \
  "dist/latest.yml" \
  --repo auckland-ai-collective/trundler \
  --title "Trundler 0.1.28" \
  --notes "Woolworths moved to Auth0 sessions and a GraphQL API. Requires trundler-mcp 0.1.12."
```
